   "symbolic: (d/dx + Delta) sech^2(x/ell) = 0 and (-d^2 + Delta^2 - Delta') \
sech tanh = (3/16) sech tanh", " [", "residuals 0, 0", 
   "]   [the same check: Rust ", "AS4-3", ", Python ", "AS4-3", "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.00426540500447*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[172]:=",ExpressionUUID->"cdd1341f-21e4-473f-a3f3-2ef4e7ad6136"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
