Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["III.L.4 The fit and its residual", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"957468de-94bb-41ec-8aa7-4724f738cf63"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["\"The Landau form is a fit.\"",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The coefficients ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1b0fffa5-a248-454e-be04-0d1940114f87"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ee50e6e2-b675-4b3b-889b-7edac9011581"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["X", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "23a7d425-00f1-42f3-9d4d-82237a672951"],
 " are not derived from the theory: they minimize the sum of the squares of \
the residuals ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalV]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["L",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ")"}], "-", 
    SubsuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[ScriptCapitalV]",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["SF",
      FontSlant->"Plain"], 
     StyleBox["X", "TI"]], 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
      StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67ccfe75-3627-4a4b-9ef1-dba1c1a5e6b6"],
 " over the computed points ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", "1.4", 
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     RowBox[{"0", ",", 
      StyleBox["SF",
       FontSlant->"Plain"]}], 
     StyleBox["X", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "469a55a2-055a-4601-809f-e35df16da87e"],
 ". ",
 StyleBox["\"Its largest residual is 0.27-0.7 % of the depth.\"",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The largest of these residuals, divided by the depth, lies between these \
two numbers for the five methods. The next cell defines the least squares \
(the function ",
 StyleBox["LeastSquares",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro"],
 " of the Wolfram Language on the columns ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d8a20861-3254-4658-b39a-6eb11f0f0035"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalPhi]", "/", 
       SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
        StyleBox["max",
         FontSlant->"Plain"]]}], ")"}], "2"]}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b65492d-4b5c-49d9-a118-5cc57e1df08f"],
 ", which keeps the fits with many powers well conditioned) and computes, for \
each method: the minimum ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
    StyleBox["L",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bb3b240b-7667-4732-af60-622a59520180"],
 " of the fitted polynomial, its value and its second derivative there; the \
largest residual of the fits ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    UnderoverscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], 
     StyleBox["K", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->True], "\[ThinSpace]", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
    SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
     RowBox[{"2", 
      StyleBox["k", "TI"]}]]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52864c77-2efb-4a0a-a03c-ed3cd961d619"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["K", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bfe64fa9-8ae6-426f-88a0-b89b9c687b14"],
 " (the quartic form of the Standard Model) to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["K", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "6"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "df9c764b-6f54-41c8-81c1-ea98fa2cfed3"],
 " (powers to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", "12"], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "229c1e50-3ee7-4a02-9dc7-37ffe61b517d"],
 "); the number of sign changes of the residual of the Landau form; and the \
Landau form fitted on three intervals, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"[", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", 
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
      RowBox[{"0", ",", 
       StyleBox["SF",
        FontSlant->"Plain"]}], 
      StyleBox["X", "TI"]]}], "]"}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",
  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4526a5ac-2267-43c6-bf72-efa483270781"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"[", 
    RowBox[{"0", ",", "1.4", 
     SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalPhi]", 
      RowBox[{"0", ",", 
       StyleBox["SF",
